# `<%= name %>` executor

<%- summary %>

Run it as `<%= packageName %>:<%= name %>`.

## Options

None yet. Document each option here as it is added to `schema.json` and `schema.ts`.

## Example

```json
{
  "targets": {
    "<%= name %>": {
      "executor": "<%= packageName %>:<%= name %>"
    }
  }
}
```
